  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.65</data>
  <data key="d37">Higher cohesion among allied states enables coordinated policy responses (export controls, joint standards and oversight initiatives), increasing the tempo and breadth of regulatory interventions targeting AI.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_west_confrontatio</data>
