  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.7</data>
  <data key="d37">A fall in Western alliance cohesion weakens credible collective deterrence, emboldening Iran to expand maritime and proxy attacks in the Gulf and thereby increasing conflict intensity.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_west_confrontatio</data>
  <data key="d40">iran_gulf_offensive</data>
