  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.6</data>
  <data key="d37">Stronger cohesion among Western allies in response to the Russia confrontation creates institutional coordination (e.g., coordinated tariffs, investment screening, sanctions lists) that can be redeployed or extended to economic measures affecting China, increasing aggregate trade barriers.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_west_confrontatio</data>
