<edge source="us_china_strategic_rival::export_controls_strength" target="ai_tech_power_shift::ai_capability_level" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">-</data>
  <data key="d29">3</data>
  <data key="d36">0.85</data>
  <data key="d37">Tighter export controls on advanced semiconductors, accelerators and software tooling directly constrains the supply of high‑performance hardware and licensed foundation models needed to train and run large AI systems, slowing capability development and iteration cycles.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_strategic_rival</data>
  <data key="d40">ai_tech_power_shift</data>
</edge>
<edge source="us_china_strategic_rival::export_controls_strength" target="global_monetary_tighteni::policy_rate_level" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.65</data>
  <data key="d37">Broader and stricter export controls on key intermediate goods tighten global supply chains and raise input and consumer prices, increasing inflation pressures that lead monetary authorities to raise policy rates.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_strategic_rival</data>
  <data key="d40">global_monetary_tighteni</data>
</edge>
<edge source="us_china_strategic_rival::export_controls_strength" target="russia_west_confrontatio::sanctions_severity" id="0">
  <data key="d28">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d34">+</data>
  <data key="d29">2</data>
  <data key="d36">0.65</data>
  <data key="d37">Tighter U.S. export controls on Chinese technology push Russia to rely on Chinese-origin components and third‑party intermediaries to sustain its military and industrial programs, which in turn leads Western governments to broaden and toughen sanctions and designation lists against those supply chains and facilitators.</data>
  <data key="d38">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_strategic_rival</data>
  <data key="d40">russia_west_confrontatio</data>
</edge>
