  <data key="d37">Uncoordinated or unilateral spikes in AI-related export controls, sanctions or prohibitions by key Western states generate diplomatic friction and differing policy burdens among allies, reducing perceived unity and operational alignment.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
