  <data key="d36">0.75</data>
  <data key="d37">Falls in investor risk appetite (reduced cross‑border financing, fewer M&amp;A and JV deals) cause firms and financiers to pull back from international technology partnerships and funding, accelerating the practical separation of R&amp;D, standards and supply networks.</data>
  <data key="d38">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d39">global_monetary_tighteni</data>
